,"s":""},{"q":"'Anathema' means -","o":["Out of date","Loathed person","A song sung by a choir","Imprisonment"],"a":1,"e":"","id":"q9da8577c01","t":"l","s":""},{"q":"Identify the synonym of the word 'Savant'.","o":["Amateur","Jackass","Chump","Scholar"],"a":3,"e":"","id":"q9dd0402af2","t":"l","s":""},{"q":"\"She was recognized as the best ________ for her consistent efforts.\"","o":["volunter","vulunteer","volunterr","volunteer"],"a":3,"e":"","id":"q9df9b39737","t":"l","s":""},{"q":"Which one is the synonym of the word “Munificent”?","o":["Meticulous","Eternal","Intelligent","Generous"],"a":3,"e":"","id":"q9e018ee493","t":"l","s":""},{"q":"What does the word \"Latent\" mean?","o":["Immediate treatment","Hidden or dormant","Frequently changing","Obvious and visible"],"a":1,"e":"","id":"q9e1c977713","t":"l","s":""},{"q":"Choose the correct synonym of \"Solicitous\":","o":["Reckless","Anxious","Uncaring","Heedless"],"a":1,"e":"","id":"q9e244cb9ef","t":"l","s":""},{"q":"The synonym of the word \"Exuberance\" is -","o":["Inconsiderate","Exultation","Indolence","Dullness"],"a":1,"e":"","id":"q9e39c7c336","t":"l","s":""},{"q":"Find the synonym of the word \"Vituperate'.","o":["Appraise","Encourage","Appreciate","Abuse"],"a":3,"e":"<p>Vituperate মানে কটুক্তি করা, গালিগালাজ করা বা তীব্র ভাষায় নিন্দা করা, তাই এর সমার্থক abuse। উদাহরণ: He vituperated his opponents in public। Appraise (মূল্যায়ন করা), encourage (উৎসাহ দেওয়া) ও appreciate (প্রশংসা করা) শব্দগুলো অর্থের দিক থেকে vituperate-এর উল্টো বা অসম্পর্কিত। appraise ও apprise গুলিয়ে ফেলার ঝুঁকি আছে: apprise মানে অবহিত করা। vituperate-এর অন্য সমার্থক revile, berate, castigate, আর বিশেষ্যরূপ vituperation।</p>","id":"q9e5c4e2e89","t":"l","s":""}]
